5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I'm Rin! I'm so excited to be here. Let's have a great adventure together!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,Hello. I am Victoria. I will observe the group carefully and speak when I have something meaningful to add.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Hello, I am Mizuki. I will rely on logic and careful observation to guide us. Let us proceed calmly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,Toshio here. I will observe quietly. Let us see who reveals themselves first.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Shion here. I prefer to watch the dynamics unfold before speaking. Let us see who makes the first move.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
